\n> I think fixing (as per your PR) with a safer form of positional adjustment may be valuable for a few games (and maybe worse for others), but there is a better solution that seems tantalisingly close...which is to cast both backwards and forwards in time within the same frame. This would be 4x slower and possibly create time dilation effects that are 2x worse, but then something like CCD could be on all the time and you could safely get high bounce.\r\n> \r\n> In the meantime, you could try Godot-rapier-physics. It has its own form of CCD and sub stepping project settings.\r\n\r\nyou implement whatever you want as a pr\r\nim probably not going to be too active on this","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5019448322/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5019451111","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120979#issuecomment-5019451111","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120979","id":5019451111,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABKy6-5w","user":{"login":"Crepestrom","id":179738912,"node_id":"U_kgDOCraZIA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/179738912?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Crepestrom","html_url":"https://github.com/Crepestrom","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Crepestrom/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Crepestrom/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Crepestrom/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Crepestrom/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Crepestrom/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Crepestrom/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Crepestrom/rep